*stat* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''stat(path)''

Returns file status information, following symbolic links.

*Parameters:*
- ''path'': String file path

*Returns:*
- Map: file status
- ''err'' on failure

*Map fields:*
- ''"size"'' (Number): file size in bytes
- ''"modified"'' (Number): last modification time (Unix timestamp)
- ''"accessed"'' (Number): last access time (Unix timestamp)
- ''"changed"'' (Number): last status-change time (Unix timestamp)
- ''"mode"'' (Number): permissions as a 3 or 4 digit number (e.g. 755, 4755)
- ''"userId"'' (Number): owner user ID
- ''"groupId"'' (Number): owner group ID
- ''"links"'' (Number): number of hard links
- ''"inode"'' (Number): inode number
- ''"device"'' (Number): device ID
- ''"type"'' (String): file type, one of ''TYPEFILE'', ''TYPEDIR'', ''TYPESYMLINK'', ''TYPECHAR'', ''TYPEBLOCK'', ''TYPEFIFO'', ''TYPESOCKET'', ''TYPEUNKNOWN'' (defined in ''libstat.chh'')
